      "text": "The jaathoom sends a prophetic dream into the mind of a sleeping creature within 60 feet. An unwilling creature can avoid the vision if it succeeds at a DC 32 Will save save. The jaathoom chooses the dream's subject but not its exact events. The target sees a brief vision of its future related to that subject, with the effect of augury. If the result is bad or mixed, the creature is Frightened 2 and doesn't start to recover from being frightened until it wakes."
